  <item>
    <title>Plaice.jl v0.1.5</title>
    <link>https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/releases/tag/v0.1.5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">github-release:454083801</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:24:51 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>Plaice.jl</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;The Truncate and Untruncate bijectors now work even if their parameters are traced Reactant numbers. Merged pull requests: Bump julia-actions/cache from 3.3.0 to 3.5.0 (#30) (@dependabot[bot]) Fix truncate/untruncate for Reactant (#37)…&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    <content:encoded>&lt;h2&gt;Plaice v0.1.5&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/compare/v0.1.4...v0.1.5&quot;&gt;Diff since v0.1.4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;Truncate&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;Untruncate&lt;/code&gt; bijectors now work even if their parameters are traced Reactant numbers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merged pull requests:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump julia-actions/cache from 3.3.0 to 3.5.0 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6150901630&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/30&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/30/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/30&quot;&gt;#30&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;organization&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/orgs/dependabot/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/dependabot&quot;&gt;@dependabot&lt;/a&gt;[bot])&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix truncate/untruncate for Reactant (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6534929756&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/37&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/37/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/37&quot;&gt;#37&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/penelopeysm/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/penelopeysm&quot;&gt;@penelopeysm&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closed issues:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Truncate and Untruncate don&apos;t work with Reactant (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6534670573&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/36&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/36/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/36&quot;&gt;#36&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content:encoded>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Plaice.jl v0.1.4</title>
    <link>https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/releases/tag/v0.1.4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">github-release:437710475</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 16:58:59 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>Plaice.jl</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Declare and document ProductVecTransform and Elementwise as public API for downstream product bijector implementations. Fix a bug with Enzyme on named product distribution bijectors. Merged pull requests: Add test per #12 (#26) (@BJMCox)…&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    <content:encoded>&lt;h2&gt;Plaice v0.1.4&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/compare/v0.1.3...v0.1.4&quot;&gt;Diff since v0.1.3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Declare and document &lt;code&gt;ProductVecTransform&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;Elementwise&lt;/code&gt; as public API for downstream product bijector implementations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fix a bug with Enzyme on named product distribution bijectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merged pull requests:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add test per &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5205889039&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/12&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/12/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/12&quot;&gt;#12&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5643333204&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/26&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/26/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/26&quot;&gt;#26&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/BJMCox/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BJMCox&quot;&gt;@BJMCox&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avoid Enzyme activity assertion for named products (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6114684040&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/28&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/28/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/28&quot;&gt;#28&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/BJMCox/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BJMCox&quot;&gt;@BJMCox&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump JuliaRegistries/TagBot from 1.25.11 to 1.25.15 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6150900520&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/29&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/29/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/29&quot;&gt;#29&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;organization&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/orgs/dependabot/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/dependabot&quot;&gt;@dependabot&lt;/a&gt;[bot])&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump julia-actions/setup-julia from 3.0.2 to 3.0.3 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6150902318&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/31&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/31/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/31&quot;&gt;#31&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;organization&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/orgs/dependabot/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/dependabot&quot;&gt;@dependabot&lt;/a&gt;[bot])&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make product bijector building blocks public (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6199993650&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/32&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/32/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/32&quot;&gt;#32&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/BJMCox/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BJMCox&quot;&gt;@BJMCox&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;changelog (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6261690354&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/33&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/33/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/33&quot;&gt;#33&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/penelopeysm/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/penelopeysm&quot;&gt;@penelopeysm&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closed issues:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;_eps&lt;/code&gt; silently promotes (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5205889039&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/12&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/12/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/12&quot;&gt;#12&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content:encoded>
