  <item>
    <title>Plaice.jl v0.1.2</title>
    <link>https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/releases/tag/v0.1.2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">github-release:390290768</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 21:36:33 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>Plaice.jl</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;(Substantially) improve the performance of matrix and Cholesky bijectors. Merged pull requests: Renames (#21) (@penelopeysm) Simplify and speed up matrix transforms (#22) (@BJMCox) Bump the all-julia-packages group across 2 directories…&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    <content:encoded>&lt;h2&gt;Plaice v0.1.2&lt;/h2&gt;
