&lt;p&gt;(Substantially) improve the performance of matrix and Cholesky bijectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merged pull requests:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Renames (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5436532265&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/21&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/21/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/21&quot;&gt;#21&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/penelopeysm/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/penelopeysm&quot;&gt;@penelopeysm&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplify and speed up matrix transforms (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5446691840&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/22&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/22/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/22&quot;&gt;#22&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/BJMCox/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/BJMCox&quot;&gt;@BJMCox&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump the all-julia-packages group across 2 directories with 3 updates (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5466295268&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/issues/23&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/23/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/pull/23&quot;&gt;#23&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;organization&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/orgs/dependabot/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/dependabot&quot;&gt;@dependabot&lt;/a&gt;[bot])&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content:encoded>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Plaice.jl v0.1.1</title>
    <link>https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/releases/tag/v0.1.1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">github-release:387543451</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 11:04:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>Plaice.jl</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Added a workaround for a Julia 1.13 bug which caused test_allocations to crash depending on the value of expected_zero_allocs. Merged pull requests: Bump the all-julia-packages group across 1 directory with 3 updates (#18)…&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    <content:encoded>&lt;h2&gt;Plaice v0.1.1&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaBayes/Plaice.jl/compare/v0.1.0...v0.1.1&quot;&gt;Diff since v0.1.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Added a workaround for &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/JuliaLang/julia/issues/63125&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/JuliaLang/julia/issues/63125/hovercard&quot;&gt;a Julia 1.13 bug&lt;/a&gt; which caused &lt;code&gt;test_allocations&lt;/code&gt; to crash depending on the value of &lt;code&gt;expected_zero_allocs&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merged pull requests:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
